---
title: 課題ライフサイクル
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> detected : detector emit
    detected --> deduped : 正規化・重複判定
    deduped --> dropped : 既知/重複
    deduped --> assessed : 新規
    assessed --> gated : 人ゲート待ち (external等)
    assessed --> queued : 自律可
    gated --> queued : 人が承認
    gated --> rejected : 人が却下
    queued --> running : runner 起動
    running --> verifying : 実装完了
    verifying --> done : 検証合格
    verifying --> retry : NG (差し戻し)
    retry --> queued : 再実行
    retry --> failed : リトライ上限
    running --> failed : 異常終了
    done --> [*]
    failed --> [*]
    rejected --> [*]
    dropped --> [*]
